    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d42be4b4befcf730c81b94</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Sep 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>专题B：有一说一｜经验分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「 壁球应该怎么玩 」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Vol.12 各种对墙击球运动，它们是不是都叫作壁球（2）</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>美式短柄墙球的产生：Racquetball (Paddle Rackets，船桨的桨/桨拍球)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>其他短柄墙球的版本（演变与分支）：Racquetball (IRF and USA version), Squash57 (British/UK Racketball), Australian Racquetball (AR)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>美式/短柄墙球 Racquetball（1949美国，Joseph Sobek发明）</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqS5cSUwGcmKcvLqMIVvrev-e4-y.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lumCopsijIae12G0FprpZYe61QhH.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvdsgkjyfo6q0cnI9oPRSJQNeUPE.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhm-u2gKvLRvTjEXSduR3Unm_s6D.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvztIEZeBcFgWIEjK1X0hY1vcsVV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhYVN6eN35_wAf2APPApN5ZzdtW0.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FufQ5ZHrdEUzi_9S7MSgK-aB7-lO.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>英式墙球 British/UK Racketball（1976英国，Ian Wright），2016年WSF将其改名“Squash57”（现属壁球子项目）</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnT6y_p3zu2Stq14_hr9NMM_zkaU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhWDp0OaPO0ptbG8bumtt5cNBSg_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlHUHfn2TMuQLpOuhqSoHtFsbor-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlH5B8sVM5wqL5agdiJ90ksJMvZ3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpbhoqrgPsCnWlJlH4OlUiDUe2aC.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>澳大利亚/短柄墙球 Australian Racquetball（1977年澳洲，维多利亚州壁球馆）</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9Jg9n1L1FYLjYn1pj2T61D6VIk.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslQkCLgGEiEFV4T7V037l3ND_oT.png"></figure>]]></description>
